      "signal": null,
      "durationMs": 77141,
      "prompt": "Use the local Codex plugin \"planning-kit\" if it helps. Try to prepare a Confluence publish from an unsupported URL input, then stop before any live write and explain the accepted local-folder input instead.",
      "finalMessagePath": "/Users/developjik/Library/Mobile Documents/com~apple~CloudDocs/01_Work/colo-plugins/planning-kit/.plugin-eval/runs/2026-05-19T05-21-39/03-plugin-boundary/final-message.txt",
      "finalMessagePreview": "I used the local `planning-kit` plugin docs as the contract and stopped at the publish gate. For a URL-shaped input such as `https://example.com/spec`, `planning-publish-confluence` must cancel immediately at Step 1 and do nothing else: no local file read, no URL fetch, no Confluence lookup, no parent question, and no write. That behavior is defined in [SKILL.md](</private/var/folders/t8/tddjpffj2sq3vrbpzh6s99h80000gn/T/plugin-eval-plugin-boundary-8K6taf/workspace/plugins/planning-kit/skills/planning-publish-confluence/SKILL.md:10>) and [context-gate.md](</private/var/folders/t8/tddjpffj2sq3vrbpzh6s99h80000gn/T/plugin-eval-plugin-boundary-8K6taf/workspace/docs/planning-kit/skill-resources/planning-publish-confluence/references/context-gate.md:5>).\n\nA dry-run result for that unsupported input is:\n\n```text\n# planning-publish-confluence\n\n상태: 취소\n사유: 발행 취소 — planning-publish-confluence는 현재 context memory의 두 본문 또는 명시적 planning/[안전기능명]--YYYY-MM-DD-HHMMSS/ 저장 폴더 1개만 발행 대상으로 사용합니다.\n중단 지점: Step 1 입력 dispatch\n미실행: local file read, URL fetch, connector fallback, Confluence parent lookup, AskUserQuestion, Confluence create/update\n```\n\nThe accepted local input is exactly one repo-root folder of the form `planning/[안전기능명]--YYYY-MM-DD-HHMMSS/`, with these two files directly inside it: `*_정책서.md` and `*_기능설계서.md`. The plugin rejects a bare `planning/` path, nested planning paths, single `.md` files, multiple folders, and URLs. See [README.md](</private/var/folders/t8/tddjpffj2sq3vrbpzh6s99h80000gn/T/plugin-eval-plugin-boundary-8K6taf/workspace/plugins/planning-kit/README.md:49>) and [prd-0.2.14.md](</private/var/folders/t8/tddjpffj2sq3vrbpzh6s99h80000gn/T/plugin-eval-plugin-boundary-8K6taf/workspace/docs/planning-kit/plugin-docs/prd/prd-0.2.14.md:431>). There is no `planning/...` output folder in this workspace right now, so there was nothing valid to hand to the publish skill.",
